takut", "ur": "(جو) ڈرتا ہے", "bn": "(যে) ভয় করে", "fa": "(کسی که) می‌ترسد"}}]}, {"ref": "21:49", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2532.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Those who fear their Lord in secret and who dread the Hour (of doom).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar görmedikleri halde Rablerinden korkarlar, kıyamet saatinden de titrerler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "وہ جو بے دیکھے اپنے رب سے ڈرتے ہیں اور انہیں قیامت کا اندیشہ لگا ہوا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang takut akan (azab) Tuhan mereka, sedang mereka tidak melihat-Nya, dan mereka merasa takut akan (tibanya) hari kiamat.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَخْشَوْنَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/048f202dedd4f134aad7.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they fear", "bs": "boje se", "tr": "korkarlar", "fr": "ils craignent", "id": "mereka takut", "ur": "وہ ڈرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা ভয় করে", "fa": "می‌ترسند"}}, {"text": "رَبَّهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْغَيْبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّاعَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُشْفِقُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "50:33", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4663.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who feareth the Beneficent in secret and cometh with a contrite heart.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlara denir ki: \"İşte size vaad edilen bu cennet, Allah'a yönelen, O'nun emirlerine riayet eden, görmediği halde Rahman olan Allah'tan korkan ve O'na yönelen bir kalple gelenlere mahsustur.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جو رحمن سے بے دیکھے ڈرتا ہے اور رجوع کرتا ہوا دل لایا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Yaitu) orang yang takut kepada Tuhan Yang Maha Pemurah sedang Dia tidak kelihatan (olehnya) dan dia datang dengan hati yang bertaubat,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "مَّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَشِىَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c4932340f6dd3677fed6.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(ko se) bojao", "en": "(who) feared", "tr": "(kim) korktuysa", "fr": "(qui) a craint", "id": "(yang) takut", "ur": "(جو) ڈرا", "bn": "(যে) ভয় করেছে", "fa": "(کسی که) ترسید"}}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَٰنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْغَيْبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِقَلْبٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّنِيبٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "79:19", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5731.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then I will guide thee to thy Lord and thou shalt fear (Him).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Seni Rabbinin yoluna ileteyim de ondan korkasın.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تجھے تیرے رب کی طرف راہ بتاؤں کہ تو ڈرے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan kamu akan kupimpin ke jalan Tuhanmu agar supaya kamu takut kepada-Nya?\"", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَهْدِيَكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَتَخْشَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c66ead0a1615bef801de.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}]}]}, {"ref": "18:80", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2220.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And as for the lad, his parents were believers and we feared lest he should oppress them by rebellion and disbelief.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Oğlana gelince, onun anababası mümin kimselerdi. Çocuğun onları azgınlık ve inkâra sürüklemesinden korktuk.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور وہ جو لڑکا تھا اس کے ماں باپ مسلمان تھے تو ہمیں ڈر ہوا کہ وہ ان کو سرکشی اور کفر پر چڑھاوے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan adapun anak muda itu, maka keduanya adalah orang-orang mukmin, dan kami khawatir bahwa dia akan mendorong kedua orang tuanya itu kepada kesesatan dan kekafiran.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْغُلَٰمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَكَانَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَبَوَاهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُؤْمِنَيْنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَخَشِينَآ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/47389d626329e9d39950.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so we feared", "bs": "pa smo se bojali", "tr": "böylece korktuk", "fr": "alors nous avons craint", "id": "maka kami takut", "ur": "پس ہم ڈرے", "bn": "অতএব আমরা ভয় করলাম", "fa": "پس ترسیدیم"}}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُرْهِقَهُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طُغْيَٰنًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكُفْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَخْشَوْنَ", "count": 6, "first": "4:77", "audio": "audio/161bd06fc5c0944a081f.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they fear", "bs": "boje se", "tr": "korkarlar", "fr": "ils craignent", "id": "mereka takut", "ur": "وہ ڈرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা ভয় করে", "fa": "می‌ترسند"}}, {"arabic": "يَخْشَىٰ", "count": 4, "first": "20:3", "audio": "audio/4729a4ddb1d77cba0ffe.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "(ko se) boji", "en": "(who) fears", "tr": "(kim) korkarsa", "fr": "(qui) craint", "id": "(yang) takut", "ur": "(جو) ڈرتا ہے", "bn": "(যে) ভয় করে", "fa": "(کسی که) می‌ترسد"}}, {"arabic": "خَشِىَ", "count": 3, "first": "4:25", "audio": "audio/c4932340f6dd3677fed6.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "(ko se) bojao", "en": "(who) feared", "tr": "(kim) korktuysa", "fr": "(qui) a craint", "id": "(yang) takut", "ur": "(جو) ڈرا", "bn": "(যে) ভয় করেছে", "fa": "(کسی که) ترسید"}}, {"arabic": "تَخْشَوْهُمْ", "count": 2, "first": "2:150", "audio": "audio/98ecc81e95f8f8c14c4a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) fear them", "bs": "bojite ih se", "tr": "onlardan korkarsınız", "fr": "vous les craignez", "id": "kalian takut kepada mereka", "ur": "تم سب ان سے ڈرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা তাদের ভয় কর", "fa": "از آنان بترسید"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱخْشَوْنِ", "count": 2, "first": "5:3", "audio": "audio/681890a7ec5f2f4732e9.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pro